# Rule 1: values are passed by value or by const reference.  A parameter by
# non-const reference, lvalue or rvalue, spelled directly or through an alias,
# lets a call change its argument.  Only function parameters count: the locals
# of a requires-expression are not arguments.  Lambdas are not a rule.
match parmVarDecl(hasType(hasCanonicalType(references(qualType(unless(isConstQualified()))))), hasDeclContext(functionDecl(unless(cxxMethodDecl(ofClass(cxxRecordDecl(isLambda())))))), isExpansionInMainFile(), hasAncestor(scope))
